---
description: React + Vite frontend
globs: frontend/**/*.ts,frontend/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---
- Strict TypeScript, function components, `use*` hooks, no new `any`.
- Tests next to code in `__tests__/`; Playwright only in `frontend/tests/playwright/`.
- Delete dead JSX instead of guarding it with `false && …` (eslint `no-constant-binary-expression` fails CI).
- After editing: `pnpm type-check && pnpm --dir frontend lint`.
